@baseUrl = http://localhost:5008

### Read today's reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/today
Accept: application/json

### Report working
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json

"yes"

### Report not working
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json

"no"

### Invalid answer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json

"maybe"